        " : سَأَلْتُ أَبَا اَلْحَسَنِ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ عَنْ رَجُلٍ أَوْصَى بِثَلاَثِينَ دِينَاراً يُعْتَقُ بِهَا رَجُلٌ مِنْ أَصْحَابِنَا فَلَمْ يُوجَدْ بِذَلِكَ قَالَ \"يُشْتَرَى مِنَ اَلنَّاسِ فَيُعْتَقُ\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.5501 - Ibn Abi Umayr narrated from Ali ibn Abi Hamzah who said:\nI asked Abu Al-Hasan (as) about a man who bequeathed thirty dinar for the emancipation of a man from among our companions, but no such person was found.\nImam (as) said: \"A person should be purchased from among the people and then emancipated.\""
        ]
      }
